              <td style="padding:10px 16px;color:var(--color-muted);">{notes}</td>
            </tr>
          ))}
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h3 class="text-body-lg-strong" style="color:var(--color-ink);margin-top:24px;margin-bottom:12px;">Why Choose Browser-Based PDF Tools?</h3>
    <p class="text-body-md" style="color:var(--color-body);line-height:28px;">
      Unlike server-based PDF tools, our browser-based approach offers <strong>unmatched privacy and security</strong>. Your documents never leave your device — PDF conversions, watermarking, and encryption all happen locally using JavaScript. This means: <strong>No file size limits</strong> (except your device's memory), <strong>No waiting for uploads/downloads</strong>, <strong>Complete confidentiality</strong> for legal, medical, and financial documents, <strong>Works offline</strong> after the page loads, and <strong>No risk of data breaches</strong> from server hacks. For professionals handling sensitive documents, this privacy-first approach is essential.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <div style="margin-top:48px;" class="fade-up">
    <h2 class="text-display-sm" style="color:var(--color-ink);margin-bottom:24px;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
